  "body": "• Secure gated setting with excellent privacy\r\n• Two spacious bedrooms plus a separate garage with additional living space\r\n• Extensive under-house storage space\r\n• Sunny deck and large family-friendly garden\r\n• Potential to remodel (subject to council consent)\r\n• Multiple off-street parking spaces\r\n• Walking distance to Orewa Beach and Te Ara Tahuna Estuary\r\n• Easy access to public transport and motorway links to Auckland CBD\r\n\r\nPrivately tucked behind secure gates, this charming character home offers space, warmth and exciting potential in a location that's hard to beat. Featuring two generous bedrooms, a spacious well-appointed bathroom, and light-filled open-plan living, the home is designed for comfortable everyday living. A cosy fireplace creates a welcoming atmosphere, while the kitchen and dining area flow effortlessly to a sun-filled deck and expansive garden where children and pets can play freely.\r\n\r\nPracticality is well catered for with a huge laundry, separate toilet, ample off-street parking, and a separate garage, ideal as a hobby room, work-from-home setup, or teenage retreat. Adding even more versatility, the area beneath the home is accessible and provides an abundance of storage space for tools, bikes, sporting equipment, kayaks, or all those extras that are often hard to accommodate.\r\n\r\nFor those looking to add further value, there is exciting scope to remodel into a three-bedroom home and explore extension possibilities (subject to the required council consents).\r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of it all, you'll enjoy easy access to transport links to the city, while Orewa Beach and the picturesque Te Ara Tahuna Estuary are just a short stroll away. With the best of the coastal lifestyle on your doorstep, this is an opportunity not to be missed.",
